@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff

StartWatch:! --> HourAdjustment: Start Adjusting Time
HourAdjustment: Adjust Hour: HourAdjustment: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmHourAdjustment: Switch to Alarm Hour Adjustment
AlarmHourAdjustment: Adjust Alarm Hour: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> MinuteAdjustment: Switch to Minute Adjustment
MinuteAdjustment: Adjust Minute: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmOff: Switch to Alarm Off
AlarmOff --> AlarmOn[*]: Switch to Alarm On
LightOn[*] --> LightOn: Light On: LightOn
LightOn[*] --> LightOff: Light Off: LightOff

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online College Magazine System

state LoginChoice
state AdminProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ContentCreation
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticle
state FeedbackProvided

LoginChoice:! --> AdminProfileManagement: Login to Admin Profile Management
AdminProfileManagement: Admin Profile Management --> ContentCreation: Create/Edit User Profile
ContentCreation --> ArticleReview: Review Articles
ArticleReview: Edit Articles --> Editing
Editing --> AccessDenied: Access Denied
PublishedArticles: Publish Articles --> SearchArticle: Search for More Articles
SearchArticle: Provide Feedback --> FeedbackProvided
FeedbackProvided --> LoginChoice: Return to Login Choice

title UML State Machine Diagram - Smart Traffic Management System

state TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state RuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid[*]
state WarningSent[*]

TrafficMonitoring:! --> VehicleNumberCapture: Start Monitoring
VehicleNumberCapture: Capture Vehicle Numbers --> RuleVerification: Verify Traffic Rules
RuleVerification: No Violation: NoViolation --> TrafficMonitoring
RuleVerification: Record Violation: ViolationRecorded --> FinePaid[*]
FinePaid[*] --> WarningSent[*]: Send Warning Instead of Fine
WarningSent[*] --> FinePaid[*]: Switch to Fine Payment

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Marketplace

state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state PurchaseDecision
state Logout

Registration:! --> Verification: Verify Account
Verification: Verify Account --> SellerWorkspace[*]: Access Workspace
SellerWorkspace[*] --> ProductAddition: Add New Products
SellerWorkspace[*] --> ProductPromotion: Promote Existing Products
CustomerDashboard[*] --> ProductExploration: Explore Products
ProductExploration: View Available Products --> ProductViewing
ProductViewing: Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing --> PurchaseDecision
PurchaseDecision: Proceed with Purchase --> Logout: Log Out
Logout --> Registration: Return to Registration
@enduml
